### 1) GET through Order, letting the selected Inventory instance use its own default mode.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/inventory/1000
Accept: application/json



### 2) Create an order and reserve inventory.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "req-001",
  "productId": 1001,
  "quantity": 5
}

### 3) Validation example: quantity=0 should return HTTP 400.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "req-invalid",
  "productId": 1001,
  "quantity": 0
}
